+  -PnodeExecutable=/Users/yoda/.gradle/nodejs/node-v24.16.0-darwin-arm64/bin/node \
+  -PnodeSha256=1ee75375e33b94fc34b3b19aede049e11dae90efb63b374dc96d6bdace70c4b8 \
+  -PrunName=js-untimed-1 --write-locks jsNodeProductionRun
+```
+
+Use fresh `wasm-untimed-1` / `native-untimed-1` names with the other tasks. Run on the intended macOS Arm64 host; a Native compilation failure is preserved, not replaced by an iOS/simulator run. The future task owner must capture each complete command, environment allowlist, stdout/stderr, exit, OS/toolchain/runtime and artifacts in a new owned attempt before any resolution; compilation failures may occur before Gradle's reserve task. No numerical timeout/controller is introduced by this descriptor: reuse the approved task539/598 bounded process launcher when actual execution is scheduled. `runs/<name>/inputs.txt` records source/publication/runtime identities; `PROCESS_TASK_RETURNED` alone is NOT parity evidence. Independently require the full128 mandatory rows, up to32 correctly identity-qualified rows/NA, all expected declarations and COMPLETE598_UNTIMED_ONLY from the retained stdout.
+
